; 取址：`&x` 之后再写 x —— 目标语义是两通道都读真地址的新值
; 运行：pini run examples/pointer-address.pini / pini run-llvm examples/pointer-address.pini
; 预期输出：LLVM 与自举 run 打 9，宿主 run 仍打 7（快照）；缺口登记在 tools/ir-parity-baseline.tsv
main|func() -> ():
    var x: I64 = 7
    var p = unsafe (&x)
    x = 9
    print(unsafe load(p))
    return
